index=windows earliest=-15m
```Detection: PowerShell executed with an encoded command (Security Event ID 4688).```
```Alert: A PowerShell process starts with -EncodedCommand or -enc in its command line.```
```False positives: Legitimate administration scripts, automation, or management tools.```
```Limitation: Requires process creation auditing with command-line capture enabled; does not detect every encoded-command abbreviation or obfuscation technique.```
| rex field=_raw "<EventID[^>]*>(?<event_id>\d+)</EventID>"
| where event_id="4688"
| rex field=_raw "<Data[^>]*Name=.NewProcessName.[^>]*>(?<process_name>[^<]*)"
| rex field=_raw "<Data[^>]*Name=.CommandLine.[^>]*>(?<command_line>[^<]*)"
| rex field=_raw "<Data[^>]*Name=.ParentProcessName.[^>]*>(?<parent_process>[^<]*)"
| where (like(lower(process_name),"%powershell.exe") OR like(lower(process_name),"%pwsh.exe"))
    AND (like(lower(command_line),"%-encodedcommand%") OR like(lower(command_line),"% -enc %"))
| table _time host process_name parent_process command_line
| sort -_time
